  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Map Data to a Profile**\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Decide what your profile will represent.\r\n   *Example: a person, a pet, a character*\r\n\r\n2. Decide what one profile represents.\r\n   *Example: one person*\r\n\r\n3. Label each part of the profile with the kind of information it should show:\r\n\r\n   * image\r\n   * name\r\n   * description\r\n   * detail 1\r\n   * detail 2\r\n   * detail 3\r\n\r\n4. Make sure your labels match your topic.\r\n\r\n5. Save your work to your **Backpack** so you can use it in the next level.",
    "display_name": "Profile View",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Label the data needed to display one profile, including an image, name, and key details.",
